  "Dispatcher variant: tests/test_dependency_surface.py forbids actions/setup-python and allows only five SHA-pinned actions, so the dispatcher here is the runner-python variant (LLMA-368 pattern, documented in docs/G17_RUNNER_PYTHON_DISPATCHER.md). It has no setup-python or checkout action; each job refuses a credential-bearing environment, fetches the exact source anonymously by URL with no named remote, and runs run_catalog.py on the runner image's python3. Its only action, actions/upload-artifact@ea165f8d65b6e75b540449e92b4886f43607fa02, is in ALLOWED_ACTIONS.",
  "test-readiness.repo-smoke keeps its own anonymous fetch step (git init / git remote add origin / fetch / checkout) byte for byte; the dispatcher adds no named remote, so it still runs inside its group.",
  "validate-session-consolidation ran on path-filtered pushes to main and dispatch; as a catalog group it runs on pushes to main only (its declared event), without the path filter. Dispatch is not carried.",
  "test-readiness ran on push, pull_request and dispatch (paths-ignore docs/** and README.md); as a group it runs on pull requests and pushes to main. Dispatch is not carried."
 ],
